    <briefdescription>
<para>Genesis-specific port view that renders a small per-type icon beside the connector dot. Icons are loaded from Resources/Icons/Ports/&lt;TypeName&gt; (e.g. Texture2D, Single, Int32, Boolean...). Ports whose type has no matching icon simply hide the icon element. The icon refreshes on a light poll so it follows runtime display-type changes (PortView.UpdatePortView is not virtual). </para>
    </briefdescription>
